    {"type": "text", "id": "title", "x": 600, "y": 30, "width": 1200, "height": 38, "text": "Security Layers — 다중 방어선 (Defense in Depth)", "originalText": "Security Layers — 다중 방어선 (Defense in Depth)", "fontSize": 28, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "top", "strokeColor": "#1e40af", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 600001, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 600002, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25},
    {"type": "text", "id": "subtitle", "x": 600, "y": 75, "width": 1200, "height": 22, "text": "외부 → 내부 8 layer · 각 layer 독립 방어 · 한 layer 뚫려도 다음이 막음", "originalText": "외부 → 내부 8 layer · 각 layer 독립 방어 · 한 layer 뚫려도 다음이 막음", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "top", "strokeColor": "#64748b", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 600003, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 600004, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25},

    {"type": "text", "id": "outside", "x": 80, "y": 130, "width": 600, "height": 25, "text": "🌐 INTERNET / EXTERNAL ATTACKER", "originalText": "🌐 INTERNET / EXTERNAL ATTACKER", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "strokeColor": "#dc2626", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 600010, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 600011, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25},

    {"type": "rectangle", "id": "L1", "x": 50, "y": 175, "width": 2300, "height": 110, "strokeColor": "#dc2626", "backgroundColor": "#fee2e2", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 600020, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 600021, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [{"id": "L1t", "type": "text"}], "link": null, "locked": false, "roundness": {"type": 3}},
    {"type": "text", "id": "L1t", "x": 65, "y": 190, "width": 2270, "height": 80, "text": "L1  Network Perimeter (방화벽 · ufw)\nufw allow 22/tcp · 80/tcp · 443/tcp · 1883/tcp · 8883/tcp  (Phase 7 only)\n관리망 분리 권장 (VLAN), 외부에서 1883 직접 노출 금지 → Nginx + TLS termination 후만 내부 통과\n방어 대상: port scanning · 외부 직접 connect · DDoS 1차 차단 · SSH brute force (fail2ban)", "originalText": "L1  Network Perimeter (방화벽 · ufw)\nufw allow 22/tcp · 80/tcp · 443/tcp · 1883/tcp · 8883/tcp  (Phase 7 only)\n관리망 분리 권장 (VLAN), 외부에서 1883 직접 노출 금지 → Nginx + TLS termination 후만 내부 통과\n방어 대상: port scanning · 외부 직접 connect · DDoS 1차 차단 · SSH brute force (fail2ban)", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "middle", "strokeColor": "#374151", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 600022, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 600023, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "containerId": "L1", "lineHeight": 1.5},

    {"type": "rectangle", "id": "L2", "x": 100, "y": 305, "width": 2200, "height": 110, "strokeColor": "#c2410c", "backgroundColor": "#fed7aa", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 600030, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 600031, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [{"id": "L2t", "type": "text"}], "link": null, "locked": false, "roundness": {"type": 3}},
    {"type": "text", "id": "L2t", "x": 115, "y": 320, "width": 2170, "height": 80, "text": "L2  Transport Layer Security (TLS)\nWeb · API · MQTT 전 구간 TLS 1.2+   (Let's Encrypt + certbot · 자동 갱신 systemd timer)\nMQTT TLS는 Phase 7부터 (Phase 0-6: plain 1883 + 내부망 격리)\n방어 대상: man-in-the-middle 가로채기 · 평문 패킷 sniff · 인증서 위변조 (HSTS · cert pinning)", "originalText": "L2  Transport Layer Security (TLS)\nWeb · API · MQTT 전 구간 TLS 1.2+   (Let's Encrypt + certbot · 자동 갱신 systemd timer)\nMQTT TLS는 Phase 7부터 (Phase 0-6: plain 1883 + 내부망 격리)\n방어 대상: man-in-the-middle 가로채기 · 평문 패킷 sniff · 인증서 위변조 (HSTS · cert pinning)", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "middle", "strokeColor": "#374151", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 600032, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 600033, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "containerId": "L2", "lineHeight": 1.5},

    {"type": "rectangle", "id": "L3", "x": 150, "y": 435, "width": 2100, "height": 110, "strokeColor": "#6d28d9", "backgroundColor": "#ddd6fe", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 600040, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 600041, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [{"id": "L3t", "type": "text"}], "link": null, "locked": false, "roundness": {"type": 3}},
    {"type": "text", "id": "L3t", "x": 165, "y": 450, "width": 2070, "height": 80, "text": "L3  Authentication (Keycloak OIDC)\nrealm: iot-platform · OIDC issuer · OAuth2 토큰 발급 · JWT 서명 (RS256)\n사용자 비밀번호 정책 · OTP/2FA · 비밀번호 reset · session 관리\n방어 대상: 무자격 접근 · 토큰 위조 · 만료 토큰 재사용 · brute force login (Keycloak rate limit)", "originalText": "L3  Authentication (Keycloak OIDC)\nrealm: iot-platform · OIDC issuer · OAuth2 토큰 발급 · JWT 서명 (RS256)\n사용자 비밀번호 정책 · OTP/2FA · 비밀번호 reset · session 관리\n방어 대상: 무자격 접근 · 토큰 위조 · 만료 토큰 재사용 · brute force login (Keycloak rate limit)", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "middle", "strokeColor": "#374151", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 600042, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 600043, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "containerId": "L3", "lineHeight": 1.5},

    {"type": "rectangle", "id": "L4", "x": 200, "y": 565, "width": 2000, "height": 110, "strokeColor": "#1e3a5f", "backgroundColor": "#60a5fa", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 600050, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 600051, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [{"id": "L4t", "type": "text"}], "link": null, "locked": false, "roundness": {"type": 3}},
    {"type": "text", "id": "L4t", "x": 215, "y": 580, "width": 1970, "height": 80, "text": "L4  Authorization (Backend RBAC + ABAC)\nFastAPI middleware: JWT 검증 후 user_company_roles + user_gateway_permissions DB 조회\n3축 매핑: User × Company × Gateway (control · configure · maintain · admin)\n방어 대상: 타 사용자 Gateway 접근 · 권한 escalation · stolen JWT 재사용 (Keycloak claim만 신뢰 ❌)", "originalText": "L4  Authorization (Backend RBAC + ABAC)\nFastAPI middleware: JWT 검증 후 user_company_roles + user_gateway_permissions DB 조회\n3축 매핑: User × Company × Gateway (control · configure · maintain · admin)\n방어 대상: 타 사용자 Gateway 접근 · 권한 escalation · stolen JWT 재사용 (Keycloak claim만 신뢰 ❌)", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "middle", "strokeColor": "#ffffff", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 600052, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 600053, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "containerId": "L4", "lineHeight": 1.5},

    {"type": "rectangle", "id": "L5", "x": 250, "y": 695, "width": 1900, "height": 110, "strokeColor": "#047857", "backgroundColor": "#a7f3d0", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 600060, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 600061, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [{"id": "L5t", "type": "text"}], "link": null, "locked": false, "roundness": {"type": 3}},
    {"type": "text", "id": "L5t", "x": 265, "y": 710, "width": 1870, "height": 80, "text": "L5  Database Row-Level Security (PostgreSQL RLS · Phase 6+)\nALTER TABLE gateways ENABLE ROW LEVEL SECURITY\nCREATE POLICY  USING (id IN (SELECT gateway_id FROM user_gateway_permissions WHERE user_id = current_setting('app.current_user_id')::uuid))\n방어 대상: SQL injection 우회 · application bug로 인한 권한 누락 · service role 잘못 사용 (BYPASSRLS 별도 role)", "originalText": "L5  Database Row-Level Security (PostgreSQL RLS · Phase 6+)\nALTER TABLE gateways ENABLE ROW LEVEL SECURITY\nCREATE POLICY  USING (id IN (SELECT gateway_id FROM user_gateway_permissions WHERE user_id = current_setting('app.current_user_id')::uuid))\n방어 대상: SQL injection 우회 · application bug로 인한 권한 누락 · service role 잘못 사용 (BYPASSRLS 별도 role)", "fontSize": 12, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "middle", "strokeColor": "#374151", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 600062, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 600063, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "containerId": "L5", "lineHeight": 1.5},

    {"type": "rectangle", "id": "L6", "x": 300, "y": 825, "width": 1800, "height": 110, "strokeColor": "#c2410c", "backgroundColor": "#fed7aa", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 600070, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 600071, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [{"id": "L6t", "type": "text"}], "link": null, "locked": false, "roundness": {"type": 3}},
    {"type": "text", "id": "L6t", "x": 315, "y": 840, "width": 1770, "height": 80, "text": "L6  MQTT ACL (VerneMQ · Phase 7)\nGateway 계정은 자기 gw/{own_id}/* 만 publish/subscribe 가능 (X.509 cert serial → topic mapping)\nBackend 계정은 모든 topic 가능 (별도 service account)\n방어 대상: gateway 1대 탈취 → 다른 gateway 명령 발행 · 위조 telemetry 주입 · 다른 gateway 데이터 도청", "originalText": "L6  MQTT ACL (VerneMQ · Phase 7)\nGateway 계정은 자기 gw/{own_id}/* 만 publish/subscribe 가능 (X.509 cert serial → topic mapping)\nBackend 계정은 모든 topic 가능 (별도 service account)\n방어 대상: gateway 1대 탈취 → 다른 gateway 명령 발행 · 위조 telemetry 주입 · 다른 gateway 데이터 도청", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "middle", "strokeColor": "#374151", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 600072, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 600073, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "containerId": "L6", "lineHeight": 1.5},

    {"type": "rectangle", "id": "L7", "x": 350, "y": 955, "width": 1700, "height": 110, "strokeColor": "#1e40af", "backgroundColor": "#dbeafe", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 600080, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 600081, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [{"id": "L7t", "type": "text"}], "link": null, "locked": false, "roundness": {"type": 3}},
    {"type": "text", "id": "L7t", "x": 365, "y": 970, "width": 1670, "height": 80, "text": "L7  Command Safety (Gateway 측 검증)\nactuator-service: command_id idempotency · expires_at · max_on_duration · channel exists · invalid action 거부\n명령 audit log (DB + local SQLite command_log) — 누가/언제/무엇을\n방어 대상: replay attack · 만료 명령 실행 · 잘못된 channel 호출 · 무한 ON 사고", "originalText": "L7  Command Safety (Gateway 측 검증)\nactuator-service: command_id idempotency · expires_at · max_on_duration · channel exists · invalid action 거부\n명령 audit log (DB + local SQLite command_log) — 누가/언제/무엇을\n방어 대상: replay attack · 만료 명령 실행 · 잘못된 channel 호출 · 무한 ON 사고", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "middle", "strokeColor": "#374151", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 600082, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 600083, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "containerId": "L7", "lineHeight": 1.5},

    {"type": "rectangle", "id": "L8", "x": 400, "y": 1085, "width": 1600, "height": 130, "strokeColor": "#dc2626", "backgroundColor": "#fecaca", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 3, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 600090, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 600091, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [{"id": "L8t", "type": "text"}], "link": null, "locked": false, "roundness": {"type": 3}},
    {"type": "text", "id": "L8t", "x": 415, "y": 1100, "width": 1570, "height": 100, "text": "L8  ⚡ ELECTRICAL FAIL-SAFE (NC Wiring + Watchdog)  ← 최후의 방어선\n\nNC (Normally Closed) 와이어링: 전원·신호 차단 = relay open = 자동 안전 상태\nWatchdog 3-layer: Application defer (즉시) → systemd WatchdogSec=30 → Kernel WDT 15s → reboot\n\n방어 대상: 모든 SW 계층이 뚫리거나 죽어도 — 물리적으로 안전 상태로 천이 보장", "originalText": "L8  ⚡ ELECTRICAL FAIL-SAFE (NC Wiring + Watchdog)  ← 최후의 방어선\n\nNC (Normally Closed) 와이어링: 전원·신호 차단 = relay open = 자동 안전 상태\nWatchdog 3-layer: Application defer (즉시) → systemd WatchdogSec=30 → Kernel WDT 15s → reboot\n\n방어 대상: 모든 SW 계층이 뚫리거나 죽어도 — 물리적으로 안전 상태로 천이 보장", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "middle", "strokeColor": "#374151", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 600092, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 600093, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "containerId": "L8", "lineHeight": 1.5},

    {"type": "text", "id": "core", "x": 800, "y": 1240, "width": 800, "height": 30, "text": "🔒 PROTECTED ASSETS  (Field Actuator: 환기팬 / 살균기)", "originalText": "🔒 PROTECTED ASSETS  (Field Actuator: 환기팬 / 살균기)", "fontSize": 16, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "top", "strokeColor": "#047857", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 600100, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 600101, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25},

    {"type": "rectangle", "id": "audit", "x": 50, "y": 1290, "width": 2300, "height": 110, "strokeColor": "#1e3a5f", "backgroundColor": "#dbeafe", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "dashed", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 600110, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 600111, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [{"id": "audit_t", "type": "text"}], "link": null, "locked": false, "roundness": {"type": 3}},
    {"type": "text", "id": "audit_t", "x": 65, "y": 1305, "width": 2270, "height": 80, "text": "🔍 OBSERVABILITY  (모든 layer 가로지름)\naudit_logs 테이블: 사용자 명령 · 설정 변경 · 관리자 작업 · permission grant/revoke\njournald + 영구 backend.log/worker.log/scheduler.log + Gateway local SQLite event\nPhase 7+: Prometheus metric · OpenSearch log 검색 · 알람 (PagerDuty/Slack)", "originalText": "🔍 OBSERVABILITY  (모든 layer 가로지름)\naudit_logs 테이블: 사용자 명령 · 설정 변경 · 관리자 작업 · permission grant/revoke\njournald + 영구 backend.log/worker.log/scheduler.log + Gateway local SQLite event\nPhase 7+: Prometheus metric · OpenSearch log 검색 · 알람 (PagerDuty/Slack)", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "middle", "strokeColor": "#374151", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 600112, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 600113, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "containerId": "audit", "lineHeight": 1.5}
  ],
